## 6.1 Configuration

Use Script Properties for sensitive configuration.

Examples:

- SPREADSHEET_ID
- DRIVE_FOLDER_ID
- ADMIN_ALLOWED_DOMAIN
- EMAIL_SENDER_NAME
- APPLICATION_CONFIG

Do not expose these values through the frontend.

